00:20:22.920 --> 00:20:32.040
But let's have a look at the survey design
for building permits in a bit more detail
and understand that a little bit better.

00:20:33.560 --> 00:20:41.800
Okay, so basically, the purpose of the
building permits survey, so the report
itself,

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:56.680
is to give national, state and local
statistics on the number and valuation of
new privately owned housing units that are
authorized by building permits in the US.

00:20:57.480 --> 00:21:12.360
The statistics from the building permit
survey are based on reports that are given
or submitted by local building permits
officials in response to a voluntary mail
survey.

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:18.920
And the data is collected from the
building permit officials.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:35.560
So in this survey, using what's called a
form C404, which is the report of building
or zoning permits issued for new privately
owned housing units.

00:21:36.520 --> 00:21:47.640
And if you go to the link there, if you go
to the following URL, you can actually get
a sample C404 form.

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:57.480
And this is the form that gets sent out to
the building permit officials.

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:00.680
