some links that you can click on and you
can look at permits by state.

00:26:26.360 --> 00:26:30.520
When you download the data, this is what
it's going to look like.

00:26:31.080 --> 00:26:32.920
You'll get a spreadsheet that looks like
this.

00:26:34.520 --> 00:26:41.800
You can obviously see we've got in this
sample here, we've got the headline number
on the top

00:26:42.520 --> 00:26:47.160
for the United States and we've got our
regions that we just looked at.

00:26:47.160 --> 00:26:49.320
So we've got our Northeast region.

00:26:49.320 --> 00:26:56.120
So if you look in column A, we have our
Northeast region, we have our Midwest
region,

00:26:56.760 --> 00:27:01.960
we have our South region, and we have our
West region at the bottom.

00:27:04.600 --> 00:27:10.200
These are, additionally, these regions are
broken up into divisions.

00:27:10.760 --> 00:27:16.120
So you can see, for example, and we've
highlighted a few states on the screen
here.

00:27:16.840 --> 00:27:21.880
So a few key pivotal states, obviously,
